# Signed policy files: the detached signatures (zt_psl.signing, *.sig.json) cover the exact file
# bytes. Git must store and check them out unchanged -- with core.autocrlf an LF file comes back
# as CRLF (or a CRLF file is stored as LF) and every signature check fails on a fresh clone.
*.psl -text
policy_fields.yaml -text
